Ensure your system detects the emulator:

adb devices


install and app APK file onto the virtual device

adb install path/to/app.apk

open a Terminal Shell

adb shell

Transfer Files: Move files between your computer and the emulator.

# Copy from PC to Emulator
adb push local_file.txt /sdcard/

# Copy from Emulator to PC
adb pull /sdcard/remote_file.txt ./

View Device Logs: Monitor system logs in real-time.


adb logcat

Restart the Server: Fix connection issues if the emulator is not found.

adb kill-server && adb start-server

